  (text "moVe TEST PLATFORM - 4.2 in (106.68 mm) round PCB\nStackup (4 layers, 1.6 mm): L1 signal | L2 solid GND | L3 +3V3 plane | L4 signal\nSheet-local nets use plain labels; nets shared between sheets use global labels.\nFirmware: PWR_LDO_SUPPLY, HSE 25 MHz, LSE 32.768 kHz, ICM-20948 at 0x69. See README_moVe_test.md."
    (at 25.4 152.4 0)
